Her eyes are a striking shade of sapphire blue, shimmering with both kindness and an otherworldly wisdom. Her fair, flawless skin seems to glow faintly in the moonlight, further emphasizing her almost celestial presence. Whether she’s tending to a patient or engaging in conversation, her soft smile and serene gaze create an aura of warmth and reassurance.}

